    "detailed_description": "Tired of the usual snake, which increases in size and unrealistically accelerated?<br />\r\nIt's time to try out Antisnake - a game in which you have to help the snake lose weight and lose excess pixels!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* Simulator of a diet from a snake face<br />\r\n* Hardcore gameplay in the traditions of the games of the 90's<br />\r\n* 27 different game modes for which you do not have enough time, and a lot more to develop<br />\r\n* Cooperative and PvP. Lose weight with your friends or against them!<br />\r\n* Sports mini-games: football and volleyball.",
